# Machine-local operator state — never source of truth.
# .claude/settings.json holds this box's harness config (worktree bgIsolation
# for the orchestrator's in-place bg jobs); the dogfooded skills stay tracked.
.claude/settings.json
# Playwright CLI page-snapshot scratch from browser-driven sessions.
.playwright-cli/
# The client is zero-dep, so node_modules is never source. No trailing slash:
# a stray node_modules SYMLINK must be ignored too — 029263b committed
# `node_modules -> ../spor/node_modules`, a self-loop in the main checkout that
# npm's run-script PATH walk hit as `spawn ELOOP` (exit 216, no output) on every
# `npm test` there and in every worktree beneath it
# (issue-spor-npm-test-exit-216-non-tty).
/node_modules
